# Butler Routes - Winterspring (Horde) completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Every Horde accept in the local census (7 quests, docs/winterspring-horde-census.md)
# appears exactly once as an accept and once as a turnin. One out-of-contract pre
# (4741 Timbermaw remainder gating 4882's item-start accept; every other
# IN-record pre is empty or contracted in-route) rides a dedicated when onquest
# mini-step. The Timbermaw remainder
# (4505/4506/4521/4741/4721/4883/6162) is handed off with per-quest notes, never
# routed and never lost. The owlbeast-necklace item-start rides a bag note at the
# east grounds. Expedition legs and turn-ins (Felwood Timbermaw Hold, EPL
# Andorhal) switch frames deliberately and switch back.
guide butler-routes-completionist/winterspring-horde
title Winterspring (Horde)
levels 49-55
zone Winterspring
faction Horde
category Leveling
folder Kalimdor
coords live
version 1

step Everlook muster - Harlo, Gregor and Shadowhoof

  zone map 1452

  tip Harlo Wigglesworth (61.12, 38.43) and Gregor Greystone (61.35, 38.97) hold Everlook's east counter; Storm Shadowhoof (61.93, 38.38) waits just north of them.
  accept 6605 -- A Strange One - Harlo Wigglesworth; Winna takes the word in Felwood
  accept 6029 -- The Everlook Report - Gregor Greystone; Garush takes it in the Eastern Plaguelands
  accept 5054 -- Ursius of the Shardtooth - Storm Shadowhoof; Ursius, east grounds

step East grounds - Ursius, Brumeran, Shy-Rotam

  zone map 1452

  complete 5054 @60.92,32.90 era -- Ursius of the Shardtooth, east grounds
  turnin 5054 -- Ursius of the Shardtooth - the deed to Storm Shadowhoof
  accept 5055 -- Brumeran of the Chillwind - Storm Shadowhoof; Brumeran, south-east
  complete 5055 @62.54,57.90 era -- Brumeran of the Chillwind, south-east
  turnin 5055 -- Brumeran of the Chillwind - the deed to Storm Shadowhoof
  accept 5056 -- Shy-Rotam - Storm Shadowhoof; Shy-Rotam, far north
  complete 5056 @49.81,9.80 era -- Shy-Rotam, far north
  turnin 5056 -- Shy-Rotam - the deed to Storm Shadowhoof
  accept 5057 -- Past Endeavors - Storm Shadowhoof; talk it through
  turnin 5057 -- Past Endeavors - the word to Storm Shadowhoof

step Owlbeast grounds - the necklace (soft pre)

  zone map 1452

  when onquest 4741

  tip Holding 4741 (Wild Guardians, from Trull Failbane in the uncontracted Timbermaw remainder): the Blue-feathered Necklace drops off the Crazed (58.65, 60.31), Moontouched (58.95, 59.03) and Berserk (58.30, 59.39) Owlbeasts, east grounds - bank it when it drops.
  accept 4882 -- Guarding Secrets - the Blue-feathered Necklace; Trull takes it in Felwood
  zone Felwood
  turnin 4882 -- Guarding Secrets - the necklace to Trull Failbane @34.73,52.79 era
  note The chain continues with 4883 (Guarding Secrets) from Trull - in no pack contract; the remainder continues, handed off, not duplicated. (Trull's Darkshore point is named in the census.)
  zone map 1452

step Felwood expedition - Winna's word

  zone Felwood

  when onquest 6605

  turnin 6605 -- A Strange One - the word to Winna Hazzard @34.21,52.34 era
  note The chain continues with 4505 (Well of Corruption) from Winna - in no pack contract; the Timbermaw remainder starts here, handed off, not duplicated. (Winna's Darkshore point is named in the census.)
  zone Winterspring

step EPL expedition - Garush's report

  zone map 1422

  turnin 6029 -- The Everlook Report - the report to Argent Officer Garush @26.60,55.50 era
  note Garush's Tirisfal point is named in the census; the Andorhal frame routes.
  zone map 1452
